    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>&quot;OuPaiWar2: The Cabin by Hua's Lake&quot;</strong>! Step into this unique and strategic game where you'll embark on a journey of farm-building and adventure in a mysterious and beautiful world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452630/extras/82081f9cf2b4bdcaf3681015f1b27143.avif?t=1739785397\" data-has-big width=800 height=434 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Purchase Plots and Build Your Farm</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can purchase various plots around Hua's Lake, from fertile farmlands to dense forests, and begin your grand construction plans. Each piece of land has unique resources and potential, waiting for you to develop. You can build farms, grow crops, raise animals, and utilize the abundant natural resources to expand your homestead.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452630/extras/f61c9adb029b09f9e2706be755ad4b8f.avif?t=1739785397\" data-has-big width=800 height=454 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Draw Cards and Strategic Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, cards are your key to battle and development. You can draw cards to gain powerful skills and resources, and use these cards to defeat enemies. Each card has unique effects and uses, requiring you to flexibly use strategies and cleverly combine your deck to achieve victory in fierce battles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features and Content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Plot Choices</strong>: Various types of plots waiting for your exploration and development.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Strategy Battles</strong>: Versatile card combinations, strategy at its finest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Building System</strong>: Build and manage your farm, developing a prosperous homestead.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join <strong>&quot;Operation Oppai 2: The Cabin by Hua's Lake&quot;</strong> and experience a new level of fun combining building and strategy!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>&quot;OuPaiWar2: The Cabin by Hua's Lake&quot;</strong>! Step into this unique and strategic game where you'll embark on a journey of farm-building and adventure in a mysterious and beautiful world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452630/extras/82081f9cf2b4bdcaf3681015f1b27143.avif?t=1739785397\" data-has-big width=800 height=434 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Purchase Plots and Build Your Farm</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can purchase various plots around Hua's Lake, from fertile farmlands to dense forests, and begin your grand construction plans. Each piece of land has unique resources and potential, waiting for you to develop. You can build farms, grow crops, raise animals, and utilize the abundant natural resources to expand your homestead.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452630/extras/f61c9adb029b09f9e2706be755ad4b8f.avif?t=1739785397\" data-has-big width=800 height=454 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Draw Cards and Strategic Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, cards are your key to battle and development. You can draw cards to gain powerful skills and resources, and use these cards to defeat enemies. Each card has unique effects and uses, requiring you to flexibly use strategies and cleverly combine your deck to achieve victory in fierce battles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features and Content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Plot Choices</strong>: Various types of plots waiting for your exploration and development.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Strategy Battles</strong>: Versatile card combinations, strategy at its finest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Building System</strong>: Build and manage your farm, developing a prosperous homestead.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join <strong>&quot;Operation Oppai 2: The Cabin by Hua's Lake&quot;</strong> and experience a new level of fun combining building and strategy!</p>",
